# Faculty Evaluation: Part II. Collective Bargaining Perspectives, Volume 3 Number 2.

**Authors:** Goodwin, Harold I.

## Abstract
These notes on faculty evaluation in the collective bargaining agreement cover: frequency and timing of evaluations, who is evaluated, sources of input, the pre-evaluation conference, self-evaluation, peer evaluation, and student evaluation. Several examples are given. (MSE)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED150915

